      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷市不是有很多\n很棒的景點嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F75E024E0D662F67095F88591A000A5F8868D27684666F9EDE55CEFF1F00100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我一下覺得那裡好，一下覺得這裡棒，\n就是決定不了要搬家搬去哪裡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E004E0B89BA5F9790A388E1597DFF0C4E004E0B89BA5F97901988E168D2FF0C000A5C31662F6C7A5B9A4E0D4E868981642C5BB6642C53BB54EA88E1300200100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就聽聽我對要找的房間\n有哪些條件吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C31807D807D62115C0D8981627E7684623F9593000A670954EA4E9B689D4EF65427300200100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說到密阿雷，怎能錯過稜鏡塔！\n我想住在<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>眼前就是塔<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的地方。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA52305BC6963F96F7FF0C600E80FD932F904E7A1C93E15854FF01000A621160F34F4F572800100002FF000006773C524D5C31662F585400100002FF0000007684573065B9300200100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說到密阿雷，怎能錯過四季運河！\n我想住在河水優雅地流淌的<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>運河沿岸<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA52305BC6963F96F7FF0C600E80FD932F904E56DB5B63904B6CB3FF01000A621160F34F4F57286CB36C34512A96C557306D416DCC768400100002FF000006904B6CB36CBF5CB800100002FF000000300200100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說到光電傘蜥，怎能沒有<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>屋頂<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>！\n誰叫牠最喜歡日照好的地方啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA5230514996FB50988725FF0C600E80FD6C92670900100002FF0000065C4B980200100002FF000000FF01000A8AB053EB72606700559C6B6165E57167597D7684573065B9554A300200100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且我想和牠一起舒服地休息，\n所以還希望屋頂上會有<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>陽傘<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>和<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>桌椅<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E14621160F3548C72604E008D778212670D57304F11606FFF0C000A62404EE590845E0C671B5C4B98024E0A6703670900100002FF000006967D509800100002FF000000548C00100002FF000006684C690500100002FF000000300200100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還有，最好是在不遠的地方有\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>寶可夢中心<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>和<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>咖啡館<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90846709FF0C6700597D662F57284E0D90607684573065B96709000A00100002FF0000065BF653EF59224E2D5FC300100002FF000000548C00100002FF00000654965561992800100002FF000000300200100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是不是要求得太多了？\n真是一點都找不到這樣的房間。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F4E0D662F89816C425F97592A591A4E86FF1F000A771F662F4E009EDE90FD627E4E0D523090196A237684623F9593300200100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以呢，\n我希望<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也能幫我找找房間。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55462FF0C000A62115E0C671B00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F80FD5E6B6211627E627E623F9593300200100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳說好吧！幫我和光電傘蜥\n找間合適的房間吧？寶貝。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
