      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116C7A5B9A5566FF0100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要和最愛的光電傘蜥一起生活，\n當然得要住在理想的房間才是！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
