      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981548C6700611B7684514996FB509887254E008D77751F6D3BFF0C000A757671365F9789814F4F5728740660F37684623F9593624D662FFF0100100002011401840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫我找房間！\n錢嘛……我就在ZA登峰戰加把勁吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƄ",
